    {
      "id": "u_ddb6ae495450ad1ce978b4e9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The pen draws at half the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Stroke width__TRILIUM_PH_1__ picked in the properties panel, which suits handwriting. To draw at the full width instead, turn off __TRILIUM_PH_2__Thin pen stroke__TRILIUM_PH_3__ in __TRILIUM_PH_4__Options__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → __TRILIUM_PH_6__Other__TRILIUM_PH_7__. Strokes already drawn keep their width.",
      "sourceHash": "ddb6ae495450ad1ce978b4e92d39fba2ebb4af4db03020729b870d453690cc6a",
      "context": "Canvas > Pen width",
