    {
      "id": "u_ac49c47667dcc5c102177ffd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Manually, by choosing __TRILIUM_PH_0__More tools__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Web Embed__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and pasting the link to the note (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_4__).",
