    {
      "id": "u_84c1eb1502c5339c9c5eca3a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the canvas note, right click an element and select __TRILIUM_PH_0__Add link__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (or press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__K__TRILIUM_PH_5__). Paste the link and press __TRILIUM_PH_6__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_7__.",
      "sourceHash": "84c1eb1502c5339c9c5eca3ad95c25b3d9783dbfdc084df62e14ab826a04afe2",
      "context": "Canvas > Linking to a note",
