      "id": "u_dfa13da9a165fca503df1945_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To draw inside a __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ note instead of in a note of its own, insert a drawing canvas with __TRILIUM_PH_2____TRILIUM_PH_3__Drawing canvas__TRILIUM_PH_4__ in the __TRILIUM_PH_5____TRILIUM_PH_6__Insert__TRILIUM_PH_7__ menu. See __TRILIUM_PH_8__Drawing canvases__TRILIUM_PH_9__ in __TRILIUM_PH_10__Include Note__TRILIUM_PH_11__.",
      "sourceHash": "dfa13da9a165fca503df1945bf41f96b2bcaa56743ebe238063d0e3c14074287",
